            <div class="content-text">
                
                <p><strong>GTAs (Bhiwandi, Panvel, Taloja):</strong> Road freight. RCM/FCM classification. Consignment notes. E-way bills. S.44AE presumptive (≤ 10 vehicles). Mumbai-Pune corridor busiest route.</p><p><strong>Freight Forwarders (JNPT, Nhava Sheva):</strong> Customs duty: BCD + IGST + SWS. Shipping bills. Bills of entry. CFS charges. DGFT compliance. 50%+ of India's container cargo.</p><p><strong>3PL / Warehousing (Bhiwandi, Navi Mumbai):</strong> 18% GST on storage (agri exempt). Multi-client inventory. E-way bill per dispatch. Amazon/Flipkart fulfilment centres.</p><p><strong>Courier / Express (Pan-Mumbai):</strong> 18% GST. High-volume daily reconciliation. COD management. Blue Dart, Delhivery, DTDC operations.</p><p><strong>Fleet Owners (Across Maharashtra):</strong> Vehicle depreciation S.32. Maharashtra MVT per vehicle. Fuel/toll/tyre per trip. Driver payroll. S.44AE or S.44AB.</p><p><strong>Last-Mile Delivery:</strong> COD reconciliation. Return logistics. Delivery partner settlements across Mumbai.</p>

