                <p><strong>GST Transport:</strong> GTA RCM: 5% by recipient (factory, company, registered person). GTA FCM: 5% no ITC or 12% with ITC (declaration by March 15). Courier: 18%. Freight forwarding: 18%. Warehousing: 18% (agri exempt). Sea freight import: 5% RCM. E-way bill: &gt; Rs 50,000.</p><p><strong>Income Tax:</strong> S.44AE: presumptive ≤ 10 goods carriages (Rs 1,000/ton/month). S.44AB: audit &gt; Rs 1 Cr. S.194C: TDS 1%/2% on vehicle hire &gt; Rs 30K single or Rs 1L annual.</p><p><strong>Maharashtra:</strong> Motor Vehicles Tax Act (per vehicle schedule). PT Act 1975 (PTRC by 15th). Shops &amp; Establishments Act.</p><p><strong>Customs:</strong> BCD + IGST + SWS. ICEGATE portal. Shipping bills. Bills of entry. Duty drawback.</p><p><strong>Portals:</strong> <a href="https://www.gst.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GST Portal</a> | <a href="https://ewaybillgst.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">E-Way Bill</a></p>

